_kbcKnurxbxK66k5-fft3iB\"]]],1,null,\"Notification always No response\",[1778821669,634000000],1,[\"Standard Chartered Bank PLC\",\"Hello Vincent Yeung, we need more information to follow up on your case. Please go to “Contact \\u0026 Support” on the top right corner, tap “Chat” to connect with our online customer service representative and provide more case details for investigation. Thank you. ~ Wes\",[1779272194,157000000]],null,[\"116813792266663108693\",\"Vincent Yeung\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyYOaKYS2y9DwprTLxtYd32Tlzs_kbcKnurxbxK66k5-fft3iB\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.13.1\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"c779fc59-0d70-458b-aea4-4ab485c66474\",[\"Calvin Sebastian\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUI0o_HsKmCX1-pQM3VyXN1RSZhCnWV0uYaA_IV3K-XL1C7x0dMLg\"]]],1,null,\"本人嘗試使用八達通 App 進行增值，系統跳轉至 SC Mobile 並成功登入認證後，頁面完全沒有反應，亦未能自動跳回八達通 App 完成交易。\",[1778554978,849000000],4,[\"Standard Chartered Bank PLC\",\"你好Calvin Sebastian，抱歉為你帶來不便，關於你提及的「未能使用八達通增值」情況我們需要更多資料了解並跟進你的個案，請於登入SC Mobile後點擊右上角的「聯絡及支援」圖示透過智能助理Stacy聯絡線上客戶顧問提供未能執行交易的日期、時間及錯誤代碼（如有），我們的線上客戶顧問會爲你提供協助，我們亦會持續優化SC Mobile以帶來更好的用戶體驗，謝謝。 ~ Carl\",[1779338255,826000000]],null,[\"107753203539960928291\",\"Calvin Sebastian\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUI0o_HsKmCX1-pQM3VyXN1RSZhCnWV0uYaA_IV3K-XL1C7x0dMLg\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.13.1\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"257cc91f-8de1-4f68-8252-6609e1a1d796\",[\"Yuzhen Sun\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwOseEkFzP2q78bVt6tpfMzTVVRDTjPFsLbSnGPZjyKcu2NA\\u003dmo\"]]],5,null,\"好用\",[1778476673,652000000],0,[\"Standard