com/hk/zh 右下角，點擊智能助理Stacy圖示，聯絡線上客戶顧問，我們的線上客戶顧問會爲你提供協助，謝謝。 ~ Danny\",[1776149315,77000000]],null,[\"109052665757597224864\",\"cyrus wong\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITfzrXTNdRKQ9V3BGr4gDnsQUgVVZBNnabaN9AlfaPfOm4JQ\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.12.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"112a8d8f-7189-4513-8c7a-eb340297df27\",[\"Sinki Cheung\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVu5L7SivaBokhCzo73ijERFKCv2u8u_ZDgjd9eogI_0qYo6TUM\"]]],5,null,\"我很喜歡用渣打銀行服務多過滙豐，已將全部身家存入渣打。\",[1775573308,453000000],0,[\"Standard Chartered Bank PLC\",\"你好Sinki Cheung，多謝你的支持與鼓勵，我們會繼續致力為客戶提供最佳服務。~ Danny\",[1776149137,907000000]],null,[\"115493000152979500628\",\"Sinki Cheung\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVu5L7SivaBokhCzo73ijERFKCv2u8u_ZDgjd9eogI_0qYo6TUM\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"7.12.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"f6c3853f-f3dd-4151-9059-57f071bc9488\",[\"harmony Mong\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLeVa3JogFzNJECao6HNGDWcwRJHGBTWkBujMIdN3BRa1Bhcg\\u003dmo\"]]],4,null,\"Good\",[1775192450,391000000],0,[\"Standard Chartered Bank PLC\",\"Hi harmony Mong, thank you for your valuable feedback. We are delighted to know that you are having a great experience, and we look forward to your continuous support. ~ Carl\",[1775626485,601000000]],null,[\"106257575536485270303\",\"harmony Mong\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLeVa3JogFzNJECao6HNGDWcwRJHGBTWkBujMIdN3BRa1Bhcg\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tV